From e0660e7ec6d84ac768a9147430fd02304ee82e55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 08:58:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 33/51] begonia-wifi (fwport-full): copy vendor SDIO/UART
 transports + 662x IC TUs

Copy the still-pruned vendor transport and combo-IC translation units from
begonia-r-oss into the fork, verbatim, so the WMT/connsys stack can be built
with its real logic instead of weak stubs:

  common_main/linux/{hif_sdio,stp_sdio,stp_uart}.c
  common_main/core/wmt_ic_{6620,6628,6630,6632}.c

No edits in this commit - raw vendor source; ported in the following commits.

Signed-off-by: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
---
